(text "All logic is 3.3 V. Each board runs from its own USB 5 V supply: low voltage only, no mains.\nNet labels with the same name are connected; no wires are drawn. GND symbols are one common ground.\nPrivacy: no audio and no raw radar data are stored or sent; only small feature rows go to SQLite on the board." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19 268 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (color 0 0 194 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ef4b4861-cdac-4dbc-89f5-c5f098ff4d56"))
